00:01:06.205 --> 00:01:07.853
- I'm lucky enough to be
very restless, some people

00:01:07.853 --> 00:01:12.020
call it ADD and I was very
good at leading my business.

00:01:14.590 --> 00:01:18.459
After the first three months
we hired a manager because

00:01:18.459 --> 00:01:20.878
those stores used to drive
me nuts, they were very

00:01:20.878 --> 00:01:23.549
hectic and nerve-wracking.

00:01:23.549 --> 00:01:25.626
And my job was really, because
of my restlessness, I could

00:01:25.626 --> 00:01:28.063
be in the moment, was going
store to store to store

00:01:28.063 --> 00:01:32.532
