00:03:46.953 --> 00:03:48.993
And for me, I couldn't do
it their way, I was a third

00:03:48.993 --> 00:03:52.076
grade speller, I had to do it my way.

00:03:52.990 --> 00:03:54.494
And I think that getting
through that system prepares

00:03:54.494 --> 00:03:57.664
