So I'm not sure, can I
amplify it a little bit?

00:04:51.626 --> 00:04:53.009
- Absolutely, please.

00:04:53.009 --> 00:04:55.981
- Here I am, I'm at USC and
it's really not complicated,

00:04:55.981 --> 00:05:00.148
I saw all these people in line
